
(7 ganjil?) bener: { Kaluaran tulis: ['7 is an ODD NUMBER'], baris-anyar. }, lamun-henteu: { Kaluaran tulis: ['WRONG!']. }.
(4 genep?) bener: { Kaluaran tulis: ['4 is an EVEN NUMBER'], baris-anyar. }, lamun-henteu: { Kaluaran tulis: ['WRONG!']. }.
(5 genep?) bener: { Kaluaran tulis: ['WRONG!']. }, lamun-henteu: { Kaluaran tulis: ['5 is NOT AN EVEN NUMBER'], baris-anyar. }.
(6 ganjil?) bener: { Kaluaran tulis: ['WRONG!']. }, lamun-henteu: { Kaluaran tulis: ['6 is NOT AN ODD NUMBER'], baris-anyar. }.
